  "label": "Michelle Obama is mapped as the entity denying the existence of pregnancy photos",
  "description": "The text 'number of pictures from when michelle obama was pregnant with sasha and malia' is juxtaposed with Michelle Obama's skeptical facial expression and the text 'zero' below. This creates an analogical mapping where Michelle Obama (the visual entity) is being mapped onto the textual claim that there are 'zero' such pictures. Her expression visually reinforces the denial or dismissal implied by the text, suggesting she is the one making the claim or representing the idea that no such photos exist. The mapping is established through the visual-textual juxtaposition and the emotional expression that aligns with the textual assertion.",
